---
import SidebarLayout from "../layouts/SidebarLayout.astro";
---

<SidebarLayout title="Home">

  <div class="home-content">
	<div class="home-text">
    <h1>Hollywood, <i>Beginning?</i></h1>
    <p><i><b>Hollywood, Ending</b></i> is the beautiful, thoughtful, careful, 8th novel by John Green. It follows the life of two young actors, Juniper and Kai, as they enter the spotlight as starlets in the film industry. Burning bright! About to explode into stardom!</p>
	
	<p>This website is maintained by fans of the book, and is designed to enrich the reading experience. We've compiled lists of the references to films, artwork, poetry, etc. that are mentioned in the novel, collated photos and videos from the book launch tour, and gathered fan projects and artwork made in response to the story. </p>
	
	<p>There are plenty of spoilers on the site, so please proceed only AFTER you've finished reading.</p>

	<p>We hope the content here will help you to engage with the story long after you close the book on the Acknowledgments section <i>(which is gorgeous btw and you should absoutely not skip over)</i>. John Green loves to say: a novel is a collaboration between the author and the reader. This website aims to hold up our end of the deal!</p>

	<p><b>- H.S.A.</b></p>
	</div>
	<div class="home-img">
		<img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/images/he-book-cover.jpeg`.replace("//", "/")} alt="Hollywood, Ending book cover" />
		<p class="img-caption">(Artwork by <a href="https://www.cassievu.com/" target="#">Cassie Vu</a>)</p>
	</div>
  </div>

</SidebarLayout>